This directory contains the Simulink models, initialisation scripts, 
input data, and analysis scripts used in the simulations for Chapter 5 of the Project Report.

Each folder is set up as a separate experiment, so you can run and reproduce 
results independently. Some simulations use the same .mat files or workspaces, 
but to keep things simple, I’ve copied those files into each folder. 
This avoids any confusion during setup.
